{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "e3e0b2aa0fd825bb971e79e98bbc3048be64f36748e498e226fbe23046a239ea", "ja": "天使たちの目的地", "zh": "天使们的目的地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "53fccaad84d40aca51467256ab726e0567820912d09a0551d371cc6ce0b9f70e", "ja": "Angelチームのメンバーに歌のレッスン\nをする歌織。今日の生徒は星梨花、ひなた、\nやよい。3人の素直な歌声は、歌織に歌うこ\nとの楽しさを思い出させ、チーム全体の目指\nす方向性も見えてくる。", "zh": "歌织替Angel队的成员展开歌唱训练，\n今天的学员是星梨花、日向和弥生。\n三人率真的歌声令歌织回想起唱歌的快乐，\n整个分队要走的方向也逐渐清晰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1000_052kao", "source_sha256": "4f8704bf81ab8e7a15e5c3040fa837ce2698b15cca5a0d2d5c83ee0987786205", "ja": "それじゃあ次は、もう少しお腹の筋肉を気にしてみて。\n1、2、3……はい！", "zh": "那接下来试试肚子的肌肉多用点力，\n1、2、3……来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "910846c8cf2e9e968a127fd530cb355f937056cd075741c0c218560c702793c9", "ja": "ら～♪　らら～～♪　ら～～～♪", "zh": "啦～♪啦啦～～♪啦～～～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "910846c8cf2e9e968a127fd530cb355f937056cd075741c0c218560c702793c9", "ja": "ら～♪　らら～～♪　ら～～～♪", "zh": "啦～♪啦啦～～♪啦～～～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ef6b2a2cc7c17ce5dbb73850659df69b0bb4a7229c2eccf3dd0672ed5c923bb5", "ja": "（歌織さんの特別レッスンも、すっかり定番だな。\nおかげでチーム全体の歌唱力が上がってきている……）", "zh": "（歌织小姐的特别训练课程已经成为惯例了呢。\n多亏有她，分队整体的歌唱能力也逐渐提升……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "5df7fde9cf6526ff80fd9d6a20104980316ec8401d21799b1daa609fe8387b77", "ja": "……それじゃ、ここでいったん休憩にしましょう。\nふたりとも、ずいぶん上手になったわね。", "zh": "……那先到这边，休息一下吧。\n两位都进步很多呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "8c0e41c53d58d72d1bc15bb12baae6df996346a0e82167a5622f8b2e08af0378", "ja": "わぁ……歌織さんにそう言ってもらえると、\nなんだかホッとしてしまうねぇ、星梨花ちゃん。", "zh": "哇……听到歌织姊这样说，\n总觉得安心下来了呢～星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "15ff1624fbfb14b5a2b530ed72b4c6fbc58a937f3c2b6723231f28a3e34f3db1", "ja": "えへへ、本当ですね♪\nあの、歌織さん！", "zh": "嘿嘿，真的耶♪\n那个，歌织姊姊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "53320a85c20bf0443c3a467064aa8a12d24f56234b8fd28065649ba2a045e370", "ja": "わたし、もっと歌が上手になれるでしょうか？\n歌織さんみたいに、うまくなりたいんです！", "zh": "我的唱歌技巧还能再提升吗？\n我想唱得像歌织姊姊一样棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "0514b80f5d43ef80e04a411261a26e89fccf90ef78ca8abba8c9c89aa2c67654", "ja": "ええ。ふたりとも歌声がとっても綺麗だし、\nきっとすぐ上達すると思うわ。", "zh": "可以的，你们的歌声都非常动听，\n我想一定很快就能进步的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "d70ca497b160e39209f7891a974d307257b7c2b3c8273f652681113950af2a97", "ja": "本当かい？　あたしの声は、\nばあちゃん譲りだって、よく言われるんだわぁ。", "zh": "真的吗？大家常说我的声音是\n遗传自奶奶哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "50d6ac473b0de1e3ab3443a68a09a4d70702a783a8c4e3de573dbc3bd6114a99", "ja": "だから、ばあちゃんのことも一緒に\nほめてもらえたみたいで、なんだか嬉しいべさ。", "zh": "听到这话就觉得奶奶也一起被称赞了，\n感觉很开心哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "08040f4e0fed1fc384c2ca05c07d1d49608f6e770f46e55db49506b80fe3e30b", "ja": "あっ、わたしもママに声が似てるって、\n言われたことがあります。", "zh": "啊，也有人说过\n我的声音跟妈妈很像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "50587406b2bc45fb7d0baa111354a7723d6c4fcad33d081490320a4f1748ff97", "ja": "だから、わたしがほめてもらえたのも、\nママのおかげですね♪", "zh": "所以我能被称赞，\n也是托妈妈的福呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "d3929c20d87df9b7abb55a3c53b279b4d69300561353ff74771004780f40ae79", "ja": "ふふっ、でも、声と歌声は出し方が違うの。\n歌声が綺麗なのは、練習しているからじゃないかしら♪", "zh": "呵呵，不过说话和唱歌的发声方式是不同的，\n歌声好听应该是因为有练习才是♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e8feb252208f6ba68fab4fdd00ee8af99151374291ea36a3afa20ee375f7281f", "ja": "そうそう。いくら才能があっても、\n努力しないと誰にも気付いてもらえないものだ。", "zh": "对啊对啊，无论多有才华，\n如果不去努力就不会被注意到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "44e82e8920cdc5ddef2440d0236912273f998717cf1ad16f880716a2fd9165a1", "ja": "だからえらいぞ、ふたりとも。", "zh": "所以你们两位都很了不起喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "3de63b500d62319efb13a0b7a63470b243ba4a45c209b207de17b51284520790", "ja": "えへへ……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "3de63b500d62319efb13a0b7a63470b243ba4a45c209b207de17b51284520790", "ja": "えへへ……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "ae628939bba32818ea7c775f6f095352783383aa89b859793b5cbacf3b203997", "ja": "失礼しまーす……\nあ、{$P$}もいたんですねっ。", "zh": "打扰了……\n啊，{$P$}也在呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8b7e13a7ec8053c04256cdbfb4cca478e9aa74fd4c1cc3f0d9ee899b7e9e4dea", "ja": "やよい？　どうしたんだ。\nひょっとして、やよいも歌織さんのレッスンか？", "zh": "弥生？怎么了？\n难道弥生也要参加歌织小姐的训练课程？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "a53cb5432973503e09c712f9a5544dc4ae837ba054841a208422c46a81e18197", "ja": "あ、えっと、そうなんですけど……\n私は歌の練習じゃなくって、えーっと。", "zh": "啊，那个，是没错啦……\n但我不是要练习唱歌，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46", "ja": "うん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "a8caba4b5177e6e708e7ba68ec9eabe238c82fa2b6a56cad23f65fde887592aa", "ja": "やよいちゃんも、アイドルとしては先輩ですから。\n歌のことで相談されることもあるそうなんです。", "zh": "因为弥生身为偶像，也已经是前辈了，\n似乎也会有人找她商量唱歌的问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "8a0ae78e4e6d4b5925159213ea9515f1e973270011c4a8ee06c74dfdc2ff0d3d", "ja": "そういうときに、ちゃんと教えられるようにって。\nたまに、レッスンを見学に来てるんですよ。", "zh": "她希望在这种时候能好好指导别人，\n所以偶尔会来观摩训练课程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1024_005yay", "source_sha256": "c21ee7e3a401cad1d85ba6d915fac74296c9df9151e3b58e3c66944eb052f5a3", "ja": "えへへ、そうなんです！　歌織さんみたいな、\nステキな先生になりたいな～って。", "zh": "嘿嘿，就是这样！\n我也想成为像歌织姊姊一样棒的老师～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "db23757a20aa4845902b50f00b34d680885f450bb5cdf26b7325b64c2b763029", "ja": "なるほど、先生の先生ってことか……。", "zh": "原来如此，是老师的老师啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "695db17ee0948fe1b603f514fa4e2be0b48cdf8eb4c02f7625aff646df5ef176", "ja": "歌織さんの教え方、\nとってもわかりやすいですもんね！", "zh": "毕竟歌织姊姊的教法\n非常简单易懂嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "5b799e28e8f21bedc373f5545bdb3b5649ccc966571061ef9f1fdeb97e487427", "ja": "そうだねぇ。さすが音楽の先生だべさ。", "zh": "对呢～真不愧是音乐老师哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "fec384375a8ccd3efb783af99d1266d1cb90cc51bf5b992ba4355bd84f51c651", "ja": "ううん、みんなの飲み込みが早いだけよ？\n教えていて、とっても楽しいもの。", "zh": "不，只是因为大家都吸收得很快喔！\n教起来非常开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1029_052kao", "source_sha256": "e230506660134b655a336679f1b251fe3070116dc9809c54da9855dff8cd7591", "ja": "それに、歌っている姿も可愛らしくて……。\n本物の天使みたいだから。ふふっ♪", "zh": "而且唱歌的模样也十分可爱……\n就像真正的天使一样，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "262f15c6e3cc1c9bcfebbd15e64ca87fa5ca583cc179c3672b7c3ba15a04c71e", "ja": "ありゃあ～、天使だなんてそんな……。\n照れるべさ～。", "zh": "哎呀～居然说像天使……\n真害羞哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "cc3f3cc12fcee45b06a635fe9b26324c73194dfc7e2b75133c8da5992b952edc", "ja": "はい……えへへ♪", "zh": "对啊……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1032_052kao", "source_sha256": "19c151d5669718a5740c33f1d4410a679495648c45c10cd7d1f0830c712b7a44", "ja": "それじゃあ、続きを始めましょうか。\nやよいちゃんも、よかったら参加してね。", "zh": "那就来继续练习吧，\n弥生方便的话也一起参加吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1034_035hin", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1035_005yay", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1036_p", "source_sha256": "3df144fd224c5058449ae92db66989260c5cce6cf4b94bf841db182944d6dc4a", "ja": "よし……そろそろいいな。\nみんな、お疲れ様！　休憩にしよう。", "zh": "好……差不多可以了。\n各位辛苦了！来休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1037_p", "source_sha256": "8cac63f8e380fe82ba81c870310db15aff4120a633dcda16be75e3b559b52fc0", "ja": "やよい、歌織さんのレッスンはどうだった？\n何か参考になったか。", "zh": "弥生，歌织小姐的训练课程怎么样？\n能作为参考吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1038_005yay", "source_sha256": "c11444a139318a9399c1abe9d73a7526a0227fd00dc7cd620cc7598074656dde", "ja": "はいっ。歌織さんにアドバイスしてもらうと、胸の奥で\nモヤモヤしてたことが、ススーって小さくなって……。", "zh": "是的，得到歌织姊姊的建议后，\n心中的不安就逐渐减少……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1039_005yay", "source_sha256": "b0f1047f0d7e741ca08fbe3876482373a50034f73e4599a26a6c09b25be509b1", "ja": "最後は、ポーンって外に飛び出していくみたいで！\nなんだか、すっごくスッキリしました！", "zh": "最后仿佛就蹦地消失了！\n总觉得心里变得很畅快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1040_p", "source_sha256": "0e99534e933d8dcc6bac1c329ba4e639f0199123d5684b281f3d134ac53840f7", "ja": "的確なアドバイスで、問題点が解消されていくんだな。\n俺も勉強しないと。", "zh": "是借由切中要点的建议来解决问题症结呢，\n我也要学学才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1041_052kao", "source_sha256": "04c4d0c32f419e2708a22f833e22eab4a9be51a439c38e73fab274b71f6af28e", "ja": "とんでもありません。{$P$}さんは、\nもっと大切なことを教えてくださいますから。", "zh": "这么说就太客气了，毕竟{$P$}先生\n教了我们更重要的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1042_052kao", "source_sha256": "6a5cc2cff7effc98e807d50b3bab78bb384b789e936010619aadbf4532b63ceb", "ja": "でも……、お役に立てているのなら、\n私もうれしいです♪", "zh": "不过……如果能帮上你的忙，\n我也很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1043_005yay", "source_sha256": "b6a193d5b1b6577411db9364baf047d47bf086a3292236e03b1462e11e397a52", "ja": "あっ。私、お茶を淹れてきますね♪\n歌織さんは、お休みしててくださいっ！", "zh": "啊，我去泡茶过来♪\n歌织姊姊，请休息一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1044_022ser", "source_sha256": "b74cdaf7b9e79101278b5be8ef766239209b1a2148fd5d31bf0a3a3c254fadde", "ja": "やよいさん、わたしもお手伝いしますね！", "zh": "弥生姊姊，我也来帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1045_035hin", "source_sha256": "66d64bb6700a36cf979e539f805a0d67c7791c60809f869f1016ba4b7e49c234", "ja": "したっけ、あたしはお茶うけを用意するよぉ。\n美味しいお漬物を持ってきたんだわ。", "zh": "那我来准备配茶的点心～\n我有带好吃的腌渍物来喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1046_p", "source_sha256": "46f864bbc4aa0bd6f95a7a26f0b7575253140c5cf06ab59c4195b4227b3e4a7f", "ja": "歌織さん、ありがとうございました。\nおかげで本当に助かってます。", "zh": "歌织小姐，谢谢你。\n你真的帮了我们很大的忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1047_052kao", "source_sha256": "cb40a3e91d606ed48611cef49112b60e89ddb628ba048545c3a1907509168c7c", "ja": "いいえ。みんなから力をもらっているのは、\n私の方ですから。", "zh": "不，\n我才是从大家身上获得了力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1048_052kao", "source_sha256": "d98ba323581a09a51d76a7d4450fed6c819fad0d3d647dc076283ae46ce4b2a2", "ja": "教えられたことを、素直に受け止める姿勢。\nもっと上手くなりたいという熱意。それから……。", "zh": "直率接收指点、想更加进步的热情。\n再加上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1049_052kao", "source_sha256": "13adb95fbca0026a0f7ff4773123cf780bf4cd10ce9bd4638acbe63b90137379", "ja": "それから、歌を真っ直ぐに楽しむ心。\nあらためて気づかされますし、励みにもなります。", "zh": "再加上真诚享受歌唱的心，\n会让人再次想起初衷，也能够激励人心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1050_p", "source_sha256": "b41d20b8dc312884ded40c90beb133ed5c56207e8310de36d92114008435edf8", "ja": "たしかに、俺も彼女たちから教えられることが\n多いです。", "zh": "确实，\n我也从她们身上学到了很多事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1051_052kao", "source_sha256": "7b865dd7daba6edc99e238b46264624dba4352ec0f46ee955113aab470bd529e", "ja": "はい。今のANGEL STARSみんなの歌声が持つ力を、\nそのまま届けることができれば……。", "zh": "是的，如果能把现在『ANGEL STARS』\n成员歌声中的力量传达出去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1052_052kao", "source_sha256": "fc2e22d9b1275c897d7787b40138c15153297c6381fef8a1917be233d34ee1ab", "ja": "今度の公演は、絶対に成功すると思います。", "zh": "我想这次的公演一定会成功的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1053_052kao", "source_sha256": "bacd5c621d31f6b63d2a56064d480ec279f689f577e906585226f3255711c90d", "ja": "現に私だって……みんなの歌を聴いて、\nこんなにも楽しくなっているんですもの。ふふっ♪", "zh": "因为连我自己……听了大家的歌声，\n都变得这么开心呢，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1054_p", "source_sha256": "7228b6de0daa1b26b6e8039602502d6a775472120ad00be48d3f3a0295ec4c7d", "ja": "それは心強いな。そんな彼女たちの歌声に、\n歌織さんも加わるわけですから。盤石ですね！", "zh": "这么说我就有信心了。有了她们的歌声，\n再加上歌织小姐，实力非常坚强呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1055_052kao", "source_sha256": "45343f1a0b2a0ed537eb65d3c50099cb1c8a61ff51a8b0256324f7b500fcc600", "ja": "まぁ。もう、{$P$}さんったら。\n本当にお上手なんですから……♪", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生真是的，\n还真会说话呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1056_052kao", "source_sha256": "23923d9de9a209cd7a802369e72240ed8d950fd3d751e469e8b4805a3fb0de83", "ja": "では、ご期待に応えられるように、\n自分のレッスンもしっかり頑張らなくちゃ。", "zh": "那为了不辜负你的期待，\n在自己的训练课程中，我也要好好努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1057_052kao", "source_sha256": "0c087bde6dbc5d064d43af2a31c3f507c9288c9451d22d31a18e07105e14a557", "ja": "私も、思っています。劇場に足を運んでくださる\nみなさんに、心からステージを楽しんでいただきたい。", "zh": "我也希望来到剧场的观众\n都能打从心底享受表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1058_052kao", "source_sha256": "f3aaff318c867494be31ba10a8f92c9e43954f10f4b0dadd64aad6c0f62eefde", "ja": "これは、アイドルとしての私の……\n偽りのない、今の気持ちです！", "zh": "这就是身为偶像的我……\n此刻真真切切的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_1059", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_2000_p", "source_sha256": "cead947f6d122df62a5c958722dca23d83a0937d815697cb1725e1483c1cbf88", "ja": "歌織さんの情熱、確かに受け取りました。\n背中は俺に任せてください。", "zh": "我确实感受到歌织小姐的热情了，\n幕后工作就安心交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_2001_p", "source_sha256": "d9126dbdea8aa498ea6eb6ab1aadc75fee9956b3c74ca21d546127e54afbd466", "ja": "歌織さん達アイドルが、ただ空に向かって\n思いきり飛び立てるように、頑張ります！", "zh": "我会努力让歌织小姐你们这些偶像\n尽情展翅高飞的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_2002_052kao", "source_sha256": "1eaffa9fe749e6c3b6b4bd903995e40b813164de6a0535d106bfea3e9da1bb80", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん。\nお言葉に甘えて……頼りにさせていただきますね♪", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}先生。\n那我就不客气地……依赖你了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_2003_p", "source_sha256": "55b01d6f80fdb1d47e65718f65a214cba42b29c5f7a8536be2b4345a5da69285", "ja": "（Angelのお披露目公演として目指すべき舞台。\nイメージできてきた気がするな）", "zh": "（Angel首次亮相公演的理想舞台，\n感觉也渐渐浮现形象了呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_03_2004_p", "source_sha256": "efc3fc01d302a9e5d34feee651996333ac71d42c5428e9a009435eeb09cf8faf", "ja": "（きっと、どこまでも晴れやかな空のように。\n自由で朗らかな光のように……）", "zh": "（一定会像是晴朗辽阔的天空、\n自由灿烂的光芒……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
